# Nexa database backup / restore configuration examples.
# VPS installer: scripts/install-systemd-backup.sh --stage dogfood|staging|production
# That command copies scripts/env/backup.<stage>.env.example → /etc/nexa/backup.env (chmod 600).
# Never commit real secrets. Never silently assume production.
#
# Dogfood: remote recommended (filesystem offhost), not fail-closed.
# Production: remote mandatory when NEXA_ENV=production or BACKUP_REQUIRE_REMOTE=true.

# See also:
#   scripts/env/backup.dogfood.env.example
#   scripts/env/backup.staging.env.example
#   scripts/env/backup.production.env.example
